            <note corresp="#d322-f1" n="34" xml:id="d322-f1-content">
                <p>For the texts of notes, dated Aug. 9. 1928. constituting the Sino-British
                    settlement, see Great Britain, Cmd. 3188, China No. 1 (1928): <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Papers Relating to the Settlement of the Nanking
                        Incident of March 24, 1927.</hi></p>
            </note>
